 don't have much Mora...","nextNodeIds":[220020213]},{"nodeId":220020213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":207401,"speakerName":"Little Lulu","textMapHash":2544201205,"text":"Daddy says that on a boat, the most valuable thing is the merchants' goods.","nextNodeIds":[220020214]},{"nodeId":220020214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":207401,"speakerName":"Little Lulu","textMapHash":2233214229,"text":"How about this. Why don't you go and find some valuable things to use in the game?","nextNodeIds":[220020215]},{"nodeId":220020215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":207401,"speakerName":"Little Lulu","textMapHash":3253634765,"text":"Then we'll have goods for you to try and steal!","nextNodeIds":[220020216]},{"nodeId":220020216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":207401,"speakerName":"Little Lulu","textMapHash":2567468565,"text":"Hmm... Lotus Heads will do.","nextNodeIds":[220020217]},{"nodeId":220020217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":207401,"speakerName":"Little Lulu","textMapHash":219207965,"text":"We three all love eating Lotus Heads. If you're being a naughty pirate, the naughtiest thing you could do is steal our favorite food!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220020209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":1022122125,"text":"You, me pretty little lassie!","nextNodeIds":[220020210]},{"nodeId":220020210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":207401,"speakerName":"Little Lulu","textMapHash":665829277,"text":"Erm, even though we know it's just a game, we still need to be careful...","nextNodeIds":[220020211]},{"nodeId":220020211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":207401,"speakerName":"Little Lulu","textMapHash":1571307573,"text":"See? The Millelith men are all looking at us now.","nextNodeIds":[220020212]}]},{"talkId":2200204,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec